@startuml ca_zasada
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Zasada Zaleznosci - przeplyw kodu i danych

component "Kontroler\nHTTP" as ctrl #FFB0B0
component "CreateOrderUseCase" as uc #FFFFAA
interface "IOrderRepository" as iRepo
interface "IEmailService" as iEmail
component "Zamowienie\n(Entity)" as ent #AAFFAA
component "EfCoreOrderRepo" as repo #FFD0A0
component "SmtpEmailService" as smtp #FFD0A0
component "[SQL Server]" as db #E0E0E0
component "[SMTP Server]" as smtpSrv #E0E0E0

ctrl -right-> uc : wywoluje
uc -right-> ent : tworzy/modyfikuje
uc -down-> iRepo : uzywa (port)
uc -down-> iEmail : uzywa (port)
repo .up.|> iRepo : implementuje (adapter)
smtp .up.|> iEmail : implementuje (adapter)
repo -right-> db : zapisuje
smtp -right-> smtpSrv : wysyla

note bottom of iRepo
  Interface w warstwie Application
  Implementacja w Infrastructure
end note

@enduml
